    skos:definition "Resource management: Allocating, placing, recycling and scheduling processors, memory, channels, and hosts; exclusive vs shared resources; static, dynamic and elastic algorithms; Real-time constraints; Batching, prioritization, partitioning; decentralization via work-stealing and related techniques." ;
    skos:broader cs2023:Topic/PDC-Algorithms_3 ;
    skos:altLabel "KA Core" .

cs2023:Topic/PDC-Algorithms_3_h a cs2023:Topic,  ontoksd:Knowledge ;
