cs2023:Topic/SEP-Professional-Ethics_5 a cs2023:Topic,  ontoksd:Knowledge ;
    skos:notation "cs2023:Topic/SEP-Professional-Ethics 5" ;
    skos:definition "Accountability, responsibility, and liability (e.g., software correctness, reliability and safety, warranty, negligence, strict liability, ethical approaches to security vulnerability disclosures) including whether a product/service should be built, not just doing so because it is technically possible." ;
